          </div>
          <p>Mission Buniyaad targets improvement across all three crucial aspects of education, which whereby comprise of:</p>
          <ul class="list">
            <li><strong>Youth Deployment:</strong> Select and place trained Saarthis across 93 central ministries and departments.</li>
            <li><strong>Capacity Building Implementation:</strong> Support the design and rollout of CBC-led initiatives at the ministry/department level.</li>
            <li><strong>Civil Service Impact:</strong> Enable reforms that influence the capacity building of ~3 million civil servants.</li>
            <li><strong>Leadership Training:</strong> Saarthis undergo PSL’s Nation Building Curriculum, focusing on behavioral and leadership skills.</li>
            <li><strong>Skill Development:</strong> Training in Non-Violent Communication, Influencing Without Authority, and Active Listening.</li>
            <li><strong>Systemic Change Enablement:</strong> Foster acceptance of capacity building and embed Mission Karmayogi within public systems.</li>
